flowchart TB
    %% Core Theme
    classDef page fill:#12121e,stroke:#22d3ee,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
    classDef section fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#8b5cf6,stroke-width:2px,color:#d1d5db
    classDef component fill:#0f172a,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-dasharray: 5 5,color:#94a3b8

    %% APP
    Root[Root Layout]:::page --> Toast[Toaster]:::component
    Root --> Confirm[Confirm Dialog]:::component
    Root --> AppShell[Dashboard Shell]:::page

    %% SHELL
    AppShell --> Sidebar[Nav Sidebar]:::section
    AppShell --> CMD[Command Palette]:::component
    AppShell --> Main[Main Content Area]:::section

    %% MAIN VIEWS
    Main -->|Route /tasks| TaskBoard[Kanban Board]:::section
    Main -->|Route /projects| Projects[Project List]:::section
    Main -->|Route /clients| Clients[Client CRM]:::section
    Main -->|Route /calendar| Calendar[Interactive Calendar 3.0]:::section
    Main -->|Route /notes| Notes[Cinematic Notes]:::section

    %% TASK BOARD
    TaskBoard --> Filter[Filters & Sort]:::component
    TaskBoard --> Col[Kanban Column]:::component
    Col --> Card[Task Card]:::component
    Card -->|Drag & Drop| Col
    Card --> Sub[Subtasks Checklist]:::component

    %% CALENDAR
    Calendar -->|Drag & Drop| Reschedule[Rescheduling Logic]:::component
    Calendar --> DayCell[Day Cell & Heatmap]:::component
    DayCell --> TaskDot[Task/Project Dots]:::component
    DayCell --> NoteDot[Note Indicator]:::component

    %% NOTES
    Notes -->|Layout Animation| Grid[Grid View]:::section
    Notes -->|Layout Animation| Editor[Editor View]:::section

    Grid --> NoteCard[Note Card]:::component
    Editor --> Text[Markdown Editor]:::component
    Editor --> Link[Link to Client/Project]:::component
